0.08 0.14 0.20 rg BT /F3 10 Tf 43 650 Td (the filesystem changes; selected checkpoints can be retained as snapshots. An) Tj ET
0.08 0.14 0.20 rg BT /F3 10 Tf 43 636 Td (independent implementation must preserve checkpoint visibility and distinguish a) Tj ET
0.08 0.14 0.20 rg BT /F3 10 Tf 43 622 Td (historical virtual-block identity from the current physical storage location.) Tj ET
